{"server":"cn","storyId":"act15side_level_act15side_06_beg","groupId":"act15side","stageId":"act15side_06","title":"传说","storyCode":"IW-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c772d5d1f6ae6824f9227143b327436e51fb71c606bffec04ad2fc6a05727456","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"年与夕抵达了某处神秘山顶，似乎是来找某个人。而掌柜也打算回家取刀，与挑山人决斗。老船夫讲述了三山的古老传说，所有人都将在忘水坪齐聚。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"6上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g08_pavilion"},{"type":"narration","text":"再过一两个时辰，夕色便要染满青天。\n三山十七峰，不知这是哪一山，又是哪一峰。\n只知道山上有座亭子，亭里能一眼看遍尚蜀的今昔景色，美不胜收。\n可惜如今亭子里空空荡荡，也就没人看这风景。\n而紧接着，人就来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这儿吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干嘛，这么不乐意见她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嫌她烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她又不会烦你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以嫌她烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么说也是咱们的大姐头，给点面子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她又不在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。怎么会不在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山下如此喧嚣......藏在崇山峻岭中，倒也有几分她的脾气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么我躲着你就要说我孤僻，她躲着你就这个态度？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......那毕竟她又没一直躲着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是醉了乏了，寻一处横河断海之浮云，酣眠片刻，没差啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，差别对待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿她别整出什么事儿来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她半醉半梦半醒，我们倒要被那群人找麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真亏她还能睡得着啊。她真的还能睡得着吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说她的梦里有什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不知道，别问我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天知道她神游何时何地，反正觉得无聊了，自己就会回来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说这处山峰本来应该被毁了才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道克洛丝和乌有小哥，要花多久才能找到此处山巅呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌柜的，您这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该来的麻烦总要来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......遇着姓尚的了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。盏被他抢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个混账！怎么这么一根筋呢——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，一笔糊涂账。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，好刀总是不容易生锈的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌柜的，多少年没见您拔刀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刀剑无情，还是用来砍瓜切菜的好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我要是想让夜儿顺顺当当地接我的班，尚冢的事，是终究要解决的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚老儿虽然糊涂，也不是那种嚷嚷着父债子偿去针对大小姐的窝囊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌柜的，您还是自个儿过不去，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谁能过得去呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一场大雨，两条人命。他的儿子因为我的失误而死，对我有怨，我无话可说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我比谁都知道他这些年怎么过来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客栈伙计","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌柜的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，起码酒盏还是要抢回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不抢回来，没法交差。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g05_mountaincity_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慎师傅，就没什么快点上山的法子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有倒是有，但是对于没怎么走过山路的人来说，恐怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，我习惯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那好。这边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"器伥","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，这些东西是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！姓鲤的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我替你当打手，你搁这儿发什么呆呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别发呆了，不知道为什么这些东西总缠着我们，而且那个叫夜半的和那个挑山人都追丢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么就一点都不着急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别急嘛，别急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......答应朋友的事，我还是会做到的。只不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们得找个近水楼台才是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（年纪轻轻，身手好得有些匪夷所思......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此陡峭的山路，你倒是大气不喘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前总过着翻山越岭的日子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......其实也就是从这几年......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我是雷姆必拓出身的嘛，虽然和大炎的风貌不太一样，但总是更习惯荒野生活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这附近几座山头的山路都难走，古时候总说蜀道难，大家都争论是哪条道，其实是每条道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慎师傅，鲤先生说我们要到这座取江峰找他，有什么原因吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他为梁大人调查酒盏来历时，第一个说要前往的，就是这取江峰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而且他问的是“攥江峰”。只有少数本地人知道这个古名，官府都改了多少年了，他怎么知道的，我也挺奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许鲤先生发现了什么线索......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"线索倒是有。他说，他在梦里见过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当他是有什么隐情，用这个理由搪塞我，我也就没追问......要真是梦里梦的，那还真稀奇了嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......这座取江峰，山高路险，游人最少。比起路势平缓，人烟众多的泥泥峰，又或是遍布戏院老街的数舟峰，这里都更清静一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也看见了......剩下的小镇，建筑，都是很久很久以前留下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有什么线索吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过取江峰还叫攥江峰的时候，这片山地，其实还有一峰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一峰与攥江峰并称“双峰回日”，本是三山十八峰中最雄伟的两峰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且这一峰万仞悬崖，最陡峭的部分几近垂直，远观如同一柄冲天石剑，蔚为壮观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每逢日落时，若是从其他山峰角度来看，仿佛天日坠于峰尖，仿佛有人以剑挑日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜后来一场巨大天灾，火雨交加，这一带的地貌改变了不少，那座如剑的山峰也崩塌了大半，已经是三十年前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要随手在街面上拉几个稍上了点年纪的尚蜀人，那次黑云压城的奇景，准能给你讲得头头是道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遗憾我那时还没来这江上讨生活，无缘目睹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾......尚蜀人倒称之为奇景？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇就奇在此处。天灾来得毫无预兆，钦天监发出警报时，让附近的山野村镇撤离，已经极为勉强，本该是避无可避之局......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后却是雷声大雨点小，除了几间房屋被稍稍波及，山间城镇，竟无一点损失，更无一人伤亡，这是第一奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事后，土木天师来勘探被改变的山峦地形，按说那样一座奇峰崩塌，应该留下明显痕迹才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不过除了留在取江峰边上的半截“剑柄”山体，却根本寻不着大块的巨石或是塌方的痕迹，这是第二奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这其中真正缘由，谁也不知道。只有一些荒诞不经的传说而已，不足为信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到尚蜀还发生过这样的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大炎的历史和传说，向来是不分家的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像尚蜀的诞生，也有传闻说与古人的梦境有关。具体是怎样的，那就真的无从考证了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那座消失的山峰叫什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......寻日峰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过大炎发展飞速，恐怕在年轻一辈看来，三十年前的旧事，也不过是些陈芝麻烂谷子罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坡上的声响","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"站住——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——什么声音？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）疼疼——阿灯，别让它跑了——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"器伥","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜——！嗷呜——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）你给我，老实点——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"器伥","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人......要捉那个玩意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）嘿，就这样，捆严实了，看着它！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）你是雷姆必拓人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）别这么警惕......我们只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）看你这样子，你不是炎国人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"器伥","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗷呜——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）——乖一点！唔！喂，你知道这是什么动物吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）这是......某种源石技艺造物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）源石技艺？就像那些莱塔尼亚老爷驱使的玩意？嘁，什么嘛，我还以为是可以驯服的大炎动物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）到底是谁折腾出这些东西来......！阿灯！放它走吧，没什么用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）......我们也在寻找它们的主人，你有什么线索吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）你是信使护卫，还是赏金猎人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）也许我们可以合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）......你总不能指望我信任一个陌生人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）一个雷姆必拓人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）雷姆必拓人也不全是好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）那就很遗憾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）......不过，能见到雷姆必拓人还是挺意外的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）后会有期，卡特斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同乡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是同乡吧......总觉得有点可疑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，慎师傅，离山顶还有多远？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g05_mountaincity_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......路这么宽，二位能否让一让？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"官差找我，有什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚师傅。你可知道你腰间挂着的，是什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你们的东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是也不是，但我希望尚师傅能交给我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们怎么认识我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听闻过些许传闻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯。郑清钺告诉了你们什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能第一反应就想到郑前辈，那想必也知道我们的来历了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台，秉烛人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你这般年轻......以前我可没见过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知晓吾等身份，为何不交盏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我与郑清钺要做个了断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但似乎这件事与尚师傅腰间的物件无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我儿子，为这只酒盏而死。为什么与我无关？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"器伥","speakerId":"avg_npc_306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年纪轻轻，本事不小。这些小畜生，似乎都在怕你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只请先生配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是说不呢？难道两位还要明抢吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......尚师傅要这只盏，应该是全无用处的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可对我们司岁台而言，这只酒盏大有用处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么用处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"饵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"钓什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祸国殃民者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咱们大炎太平了好几百年了，哪来的祸国殃民者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不足为外人道也。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，请尚师傅相信，将酒盏托付给我们，就是天大的义举。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！义举......我这种人，瞧不起，也配不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......让开吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这恐怕不由尚师傅说了算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这只酒盏是我儿子的陪葬。除非郑清钺亲自来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否则，免谈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"取江峰忘水坪，我等他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不识抬举！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——棍法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——势大力沉，你这老牛，蛮力倒是有几分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公子，此人深藏不露，绝非善类。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"取货为先，别和这人纠缠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二位可曾听郑清钺说过，我生平最恨哪几个字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫插科打诨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我最恨，“先救货，再救人”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
